### Summary

The diff has one small gap. The `unchanged` flag flows from `relocate.ts` through `index.ts` into the renderer, where `onRelocated` skips the toast, and `relocate.test.ts` pins it at the main-process level. I found no defect in the changed code. The `registry.ts` change keeps `pendingInit` after an offline edit, which makes the moved-folder relocate work. The probe then writes the identity from the registry's name and color, and the new test covers this path. The gap is that nothing tests the forwarding in `index.ts` or the silent branch in the renderer, so I raised that as a low-priority "consider". The earlier threads on `relocate.ts` and `registry.ts` are addressed.

